# Xilinx Vivado bitstream/programming-file outputs — always binary.
# Without this, git's heuristic can misdetect these as text (long runs of
# 0x00/repeated bytes near the start) and diff/PR views render them as a
# wall of garbage instead of "Binary files differ". They're also pointless
# to line-diff: place & route changes the whole .bit on almost any RTL
# change, so there's never a meaningful line-level delta to show.
*.bit binary
*.bin binary
*.ltx binary
*.mcs binary
*.prm binary
